  "findings": [
    "The primary programme and all compulsory module records independently establish the cumulative molecular/chemical, microbial, physical, quantitative and process-engineering identity. The current public degree page and October2026 course diagram corroborate laboratory work, product development, industry cases and an individual thesis. Official metadata, not an imagined UCR response, determines the target.",
    "Twenty-five credited compulsory courses total123EC:57inB1,60inB2,6inB3. General/LaboratorySafety have0EC and remain practical obligations. ThreeECpreparation-dependent mathematics yields60ECfirstyear. The common total is150EC after the24ECthesis;30ECminor/electives closes180.",
    "The mathematics group requires one of MAT14803/MAT15303 according to prior education and study advice. This illustration uses MathematicsA-or-equivalent preparation and MAT14803, whose assumed preparation and continuation into Analysis/LinearAlgebra are explicit. Official order is not the selection criterion; the other3ECStatistics1 option remains recognised.",
    "The supplementary RO2 cluster has0minimum and no course is arbitrarily added. An optional12ECinternship replaces elective credits. The generic programme has no formal specialisation; the named animal-origin/eating-behaviour minors are optional choices in open space, not extra compulsory content.",
    "The programme thesis group requires102compulsory/restricted credits includingall60firstyear. YFS80824 separately assumes second-year BFT courses and describes individual research: proposal, work/data, feedback, report, colloquium and oral examination. Completing120ECinB1/B2 before the final-year30ECcase/thesis package supplies the stated preparation without importing another degree’s chair matrix.",
    "Safety is a mandatory prerequisite for the relevant chemistry, cell, microbial, nutrition, food-physics and integration laboratories. Second-year food chemistry, microbiology, physics and processing provide the stated preparation for the integration practical and final industry case. Course-level assumed knowledge is distinct from hard programme credits; older mathematics labels in assumptions do not add absent courses.",
    "The current minor records corroborate two different academic directions. WUPEB integrates neuroscience, sensory/consumer science, psychology and behaviour change. WUFAO concerns meat/milk/insects, product quality and food-related allergy/intolerance. These details inform candidate assessment while leaving the generic comparator electives open.",
    "The actual ELS10301 content supplies presentation delivery, peer observation and reflection. UCRPPD has a bounded oral-presentation correspondence, rather than a generic claim that any research or personal-development course is equivalent. No essential external-source gap remains."
  ],
